## Component Hierarchy Layers

### Layer 1: Root Layout
**Root Layout** (`app/layout.tsx`):
- Top-level component
- Wraps entire application
- Configures global providers
- Loads global styles and fonts
- Sets metadata (SEO)

### Layer 2: Providers
Global context providers that wrap the application:

#### Apollo Provider
- GraphQL client configuration
- Cache management
- Error handling
- WebSocket for subscriptions

#### Theme Provider (`next-themes`)
- Dark/Light mode support
- System preference detection
- Theme persistence (localStorage)
- CSS class-based theming

#### i18n Provider (`next-intl`)
- Internationalization (en, ru)
- Message loading and aggregation
- Typed translations
- Language switching

#### Toaster Provider (`sonner`)
- Toast notification system
- Success, error, info, warning types
- Auto-dismiss configuration
- Position control

### Layer 3: Layout Components
Layout wrappers for different page types:

#### Public Layout
- Minimal layout for auth pages
- No navigation
- Logo and language selector
- Centered content area

#### Protected Layout
- Full application layout
- Requires authentication
- Header with navigation
- Sidebar (optional)
- Content area with max-width

#### Header Widget
Composed of:
- **Navbar**: Logo, navigation links
- **User Dropdown**: Profile menu, logout
- **Language Selector**: en/ru switching
- **Theme Switcher**: Light/dark toggle

#### Sidebar Widget
- Navigation menu
- Collapsible on mobile
- Active state indication
- Icon + text labels

### Layer 4: Page Components
Top-level page components mapped to routes:

#### Auth Pages (Public)
- **Login Page**: Multi-step login with 2FA support
- **Register Page**: Two-step registration (contact info → password)
- **Verify Email Page**: Email verification flow
- **Password Recovery**: Reset password flow

#### Protected Pages
- **Dashboard Page**: Main application dashboard
- **Settings Page**: User profile and security settings
- **Organization Page**: Organization management

### Layer 5: Feature Components
Business logic components with state and API interactions:

#### Auth Features
- **Login Form**: Email/password → Optional 2FA
- **Register Form**: Multi-step with validation
- **Reset Password Form**: Email input → Token validation → New password
- **OTP Form**: 6-digit code input with countdown
- **WebAuthn Flow**: Biometric/security key authentication

#### Dashboard Features
- **Stats Widget**: Key metrics display (cards)
- **Chart Widget**: Data visualization (charts, graphs)
- **Activity Feed**: Recent user actions timeline

#### Settings Features
- **Profile Form**: Name, email, phone, avatar
- **Change Password Form**: Current → New → Confirm
- **2FA Setup**: Tabs for TOTP, OTP Email, OTP SMS, WebAuthn
- **Session List**: Active sessions table with device info

#### Organization Features
- **Organization List**: Table with pagination and filters
- **Organization Form**: Create/edit organization details
- **Member List**: Team member management

#### Shared Features
- **Navbar**: Top navigation with links
- **User Dropdown**: Avatar + menu (profile, settings, logout)
- **Language Selector**: Dropdown for language switching
- **Theme Switcher**: Button to toggle dark/light mode

### Layer 6: Atomic UI Components
Reusable design system components (42+ components):

#### Form Components (10)
- **Button**: 4 variants (primary, outline, ghost, destructive), 4 sizes
- **Input**: Text, email, password with validation states
- **Input Phone**: International phone number with formatting
- **Input OTP**: 6-digit code input (2FA)
- **Textarea**: Multi-line text input
- **Select**: Dropdown select with search
- **Checkbox**: Boolean toggle
- **Switch**: On/off toggle
- **Label**: Form field label
- **Form Field**: React Hook Form integration wrapper

#### Layout Components (7)
- **Card**: Container with padding, border, shadow
- **Dialog**: Modal dialog with overlay
- **Popover**: Floating popover container
- **Dropdown Menu**: Context menu with items
- **Sheet**: Slide-in panel (mobile menu)
- **Tabs**: Tab navigation with panels
- **Accordion**: Collapsible sections

#### Display Components (6)
- **Avatar**: Circular user image with fallback
- **Badge**: Colored tag for status/labels
- **Alert**: Message box (info, success, warning, error)
- **Tooltip**: Hover tooltip
- **Separator**: Horizontal/vertical divider
- **Scroll Area**: Custom scrollbar styling

#### Data Components (4)
- **Table**: Data table with header, body, footer
- **Command**: Command palette with search
- **Calendar**: Date picker calendar
- **Slider**: Range slider input

#### Feedback Components (4)
- **Toast**: Notification toast (success, error, info)
- **Progress**: Progress bar
- **Skeleton**: Loading placeholder
- **Spinner**: Loading spinner icon

#### Logo Components (4)
- **Logo Full**: Icon + text (full logo)
- **Logo Icon**: Icon only
- **Logo Mini**: Smaller icon version
- **Logo Text**: Text only

#### Utility Components (3)
- **User Avatar**: Avatar with fallback to initials
- **Countdown**: Timer display (seconds remaining)
- **Hint**: Info hint icon with popover

## Component Patterns

### Composition Pattern
Components compose smaller components:
```
LoginPage
  └─ LoginForm
       ├─ Card
       ├─ Input (email)
       ├─ Input (password)
       ├─ Button (submit)
       └─ OTPForm (conditional)
            ├─ InputOTP
            ├─ Countdown
            └─ Button (verify)
```

### Form Pattern
All forms use React Hook Form + Zod:
```
Form (Provider)
  └─ form.onSubmit
       ├─ FormField (controller)
       │    ├─ FormLabel
       │    ├─ FormControl
       │    │    └─ Input
       │    ├─ FormDescription
       │    └─ FormMessage (errors)
       └─ Button (submit)
```

### Feature-Sliced Design
Modules follow consistent structure:
```
modules/auth/
  ├─ pages/         # Page exports
  ├─ features/      # Forms, flows
  ├─ widgets/       # Composed blocks
  └─ shared/        # Utils, API, i18n
```

### Atomic Design
Components hierarchically organized:
- **Atoms**: Button, Input, Label (basic)
- **Molecules**: FormField, UserAvatar (composed)
- **Organisms**: LoginForm, Header (complex)
- **Templates**: Layout components
- **Pages**: Full pages

### Prop Drilling vs Context
- Use Zustand for global state (auth, app UI)
- Use Context for provider-based state (theme, i18n)
- Pass props directly for component-specific data

### Component Styling
All components use Tailwind CSS with CVA (Class Variance Authority):
```typescript
const buttonVariants = cva('base-classes', {
  variants: {
    variant: { primary: '...', outline: '...' },
    size: { default: '...', lg: '...', sm: '...' }
  }
})
```

## State Management

### Zustand Stores
- **App Store**: UI state (sidebar open/closed)
- **Auth Store**: 2FA state, status pages, password step

### React Hook Form
- Form state management
- Validation (Zod schemas)
- Error handling
- Submission

### Apollo Client Cache
- GraphQL query caching
- Automatic cache updates
- Optimistic updates

## Styling System

### Tailwind CSS
- Utility-first styling
- JIT compilation
- Custom theme tokens
- Responsive utilities

### CSS Variables
- Theme colors
- Typography scale
- Spacing scale
- Border radius

### Component Variants
- CVA for variant management
- Size variants
- Color variants
- State variants (hover, active, disabled)

## Accessibility

### ARIA
- All components have proper ARIA attributes
- Keyboard navigation support
- Screen reader friendly

### Focus Management
- Visible focus indicators
- Logical tab order
- Focus trap in dialogs

### Semantic HTML
- Proper heading hierarchy
- Semantic landmarks
- Form labels associated with inputs
